@startuml C1_VVE_Creation_Process
title C1 – VVE Creation (High-Level Process)

start
:Operator selects eligible VVN;
:SPA pre-fills vessel data and asks for arrival timestamp;
:Operator confirms creation;
:SPA calls TodoApi POST /vvns/{vvnId}/vves;
:TodoApi validates identity and forwards to OEM;
:OEM service validates VVN status and persists VVE (status=InProgress);
:OEM returns VVE id and details;
:TodoApi relays response to SPA;
:SPA shows confirmation and marks visit as In Progress;
stop

@enduml
